{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-01T21:46:36.711Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"b343c237d9dd86b74913bb91","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.316","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-01T21:46:36.711Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Codex review round 1 on PR #1649. Two findings on this item, both verified and fixed:\n- Identity collision: if the replacement has the same identity (command, path, scope, context modes) as another entry, the add path deduplicates it away, so the advertised retry would delete the selected entry and add nothing. The refusal now detects this using linkedTestsHaveSameIdentity (moved to entry.ts and shared with the add path), offers no retry, and names the colliding entry's --update-index and the selected entry's --remove-index.\n- Silently dropped companion fields: the rest of the patch is validated before a retry is built. Unsupported keys, scope:null and invalid values (parsed exactly as --add-json parses them) now refuse instead of being dropped.\nThe integration spec covers the collision, unsupported key, scope:null and negative timeout cases, each with unchanged bytes.\n"}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-01T21:46:36.711Z"}],"before_hash":"227c3140a4cb8fb07b6cf94fca02f62c847f642202e439136a8af969bfa96479","after_hash":"bd8d572825cd0ac6bd636250db01d77be229fedf50c470972f58ecfcf30b834b","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"0a3192446a1c22ce68d0681b97a1d1494c79b9f37f2b60afae40ce961911bc48"}
