{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-01T22:35:05.015Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"b343c237d9dd86b74913bb91","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.316","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-01T22:35:05.014Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Codex review round 2 on PR #1649: three findings on this item, all verified and fixed.\n- Conflicting command/cmd values collapsed silently: they now refuse, matching the add parser. Equal aliases are still accepted.\n- A replacement invoking pm test-all got a retry the add path would refuse. The recursion guard (assertNoRecursiveTestAllCommand and its helpers) moved from execution.ts to linked-command-detection.ts so update.ts can share it without an import cycle; the refusal now carries that reason and no retry.\n- The retry dropped explicit controls. --author, --message and --force from the refused edit are now appended to the retry, so ownership and provenance match the request.\nThe command-edit refusal is split into resolveRequestedCommand, admitReplacementEntry and replacementControlArgs to stay under the complexity cap.\n"}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-01T22:35:05.015Z"}],"before_hash":"654f46b2387f8325c22929643fdef40a183bce3320161e3f68b2a70489a17210","after_hash":"d8d275e4493aa604860cdd011d7a719f3d143fb54f2886a099ef87898c905907","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"505e5227ed3582862ee52fce05e8731f2d2d2631560c32e12befa5a1aa07a58f"}
